comment0.text=\r\n\ A\ circle\ that\ can\ be\ manipulated\ and\ that\ draws\ itself\ on\ a\ canvas.\r\n\ \r\n\ @author\ David\ Garzon,\ Wilson\ Mendivelso\r\n\ @version\ 0.1\r\n
